OL,3,GNEWSATaxpayers will foot bill for
OL,4,Ashortfall on PFI hospital upgrades
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of millions of pounds of
OL,7,Ftaxpayers' cash will be needed to bring
OL,8,Fthe Royal Infirmary of Edinburgh (RIE)
OL,9,Fup to scratch when it transfers to
OL,10,Fpublic ownership next year, BBC
OL,11,FScotland can reveal.
OL,13,FThe RIE was built in 2002 using the
OL,14,FPrivate Finance Initiative (PFI) model
OL,15,Fwhich saw operator Consort Healthcare
OL,16,Freceive around #1bn to build and then
OL,17,Fmaintain the hospital over 25 years
OL,18,Fbefore handing it back to the NHS.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
