OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATaxpayers will foot bill for
OL,4,Ashortfall on PFI hospital upgrades
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS Lothian and Consort were locked in
OL,7,Fa four-year dispute about maintenance
OL,8,Fstandards at the RIE but have now
OL,9,Freached a deal where Consort will set
OL,10,Faside up to #86m for upgrades.
OL,12,FHowever, an NHS Lothian assessment said
OL,13,Fthis sum is "anticipated to fall well
OL,14,Fshort" of what is needed.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
